            {
                "comment": "Knowledgable professor and extrememly helpful if you go to her office hours or participate in class. Be prepared for a lot of homework though. Attendance is mandatory and she'll mark you down if you miss class. Participate, do your homework, and ask for help, and you'll enjoy her.",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Great Professor, attend class, go to her office hours, ask questions in class and you will do fine. There is a lot of work involved, but manageable. She grades essay's hard because she want her students to become better writers in Spanish",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "She is a bit rough to take a class with but you do learn a lot. She sometimes will ramble on. I do feel that there could be less hw seeing as most of it is just busy work which is annoying and a waste of time.  Be prepared for the tests as they can be a bit brutal.  The papers are pretty easy though.  Good spanish prof but not the best...",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 4
